  "description": "Proposed upgrading of 77no. flat entrance doors to achieve equivalence of FD30S fire rating. Proposed works to the doors include: \n- Replacing overhead door closers, hinges, letter plates and lock sets with fire rated products\n- Repairing any damage to doors and architraves\n- Installing intumescent smoke seals to door leaf top and sides.\n- Apply white intumescent paint to the inside of door frames and architrave\n- Replace existing lining to inside face of door leaf with new fire rated lining\n- Adjusting the position of the fanlight and installing fire rated secondary glazing",
  "decision_conditions": [
